# Design System

Before creating any visual component, check existing design tokens. Do not use isolated hex values when a token exists.

## Themes

The site supports `light` and `dark` themes via the `.dark` class on `<html>`. Default is dark. Hex values live only in `app/assets/stylesheets/design_tokens.css`.

| Token | Dark | Light | Tailwind |
|---|---|---|---|
| primary | `#6366F1` | `#6366F1` | `bg-primary` `text-primary` |
| primary-light | `#818CF8` | `#818CF8` | `bg-primary-light` |
| primary-dark | `#4F46E5` | `#4F46E5` | `bg-primary-dark` |
| secondary | `#8B5CF6` | `#8B5CF6` | `bg-secondary` |
| accent | `#06B6D4` | `#06B6D4` | `bg-accent` (sparingly) |
| background | `#0B1120` | `#F8FAFC` | `bg-background` |
| surface | `#111827` | `#F1F5F9` | `bg-surface` |
| surface-light | `#1E293B` | `#E2E8F0` | `bg-surface-light` |
| text | `#F8FAFC` | `#0F172A` | `text-text` |
| text-muted | `#94A3B8` | `#64748B` | `text-text-muted` |
| border | `#334155` | `#CBD5E1` | `border-border` |
| success | `#22C55E` | `#22C55E` | `text-success` |
| warning | `#F59E0B` | `#F59E0B` | `text-warning` |
| danger | `#EF4444` | `#EF4444` | `text-danger` |

**Exception:** skill/brand icons may use official brand hex on hover only (from `simple-icons` data, not design tokens).

```html
<!-- BAD -->
<div class="bg-[#0B1120] text-[#F8FAFC]">

<!-- GOOD -->
<div class="bg-background text-text">
```

Accent is for small highlights only. Do not invent new colors.

## UI

Dark, minimal, professional, technological. No gamer look, neon, heavy gradients, or excess shadows.

Keep spacing, border-radius, and typography consistent. Prefer readability, contrast, and a clear hierarchy.

Avo must use this same identity (`config.appearance` + `avo-overrides.css`). Do not create a separate admin theme.
